sentences.text:
The owner and insurer of the motorcycle are jointly and severally held liable to pay the compensation and the Insurance Company is directed to deposit the compensation amount with accrued interest within a period of eight weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
v. Amount in deposit, if any, along with Trial Court records, shall be transmitted to the Tribunal,
forthwith;

